            <text fontFamily='Microsoft YaHei' x='20' y='58' fontSize='13' fill='#EAF3FC'>matplotlib 折线图 / 散点图</text>
            <text fontFamily='Microsoft YaHei' x='20' y='80' fontSize='13' fill='#EAF3FC'>随机游走 · Plotly 掷骰子</text>
            <text fontFamily='Microsoft YaHei' x='20' y='104' fontSize='12.5' fill='#BFD9F2'>第 15 章</text>

            <rect x='391' y='0' width='370' height='120' rx='10' fill='#2F7BC8' />
            <text fontFamily='Microsoft YaHei' x='411' y='32' fontSize='16' fontWeight='bold' fill='#FFFFFF'>单元 16 · 下载真实数据</text>
            <text fontFamily='Microsoft YaHei' x='411' y='58' fontSize='13' fill='#EAF3FC'>CSV 气温图 · GeoJSON 地震散点</text>
            <text fontFamily='Microsoft YaHei' x='411' y='80' fontSize='13' fill='#EAF3FC'>datetime · 缺失值 · 地图</text>
            <text fontFamily='Microsoft YaHei' x='411' y='104' fontSize='12.5' fill='#BFD9F2'>第 16 章</text>

            <rect x='782' y='0' width='370' height='120' rx='10' fill='#0E9B78' />
            <text fontFamily='Microsoft YaHei' x='802' y='32' fontSize='16' fontWeight='bold' fill='#FFFFFF'>单元 17 · 调用 API</text>
            <text fontFamily='Microsoft YaHei' x='802' y='58' fontSize='13' fill='#D7F0E7'>requests 取 GitHub / HN 数据</text>
            <text fontFamily='Microsoft YaHei' x='802' y='80' fontSize='13' fill='#D7F0E7'>速率限制 · Plotly 交互图</text>
            <text fontFamily='Microsoft YaHei' x='802' y='104' fontSize='12.5' fill='#B9E4D5'>第 17 章</text>

            <text fontFamily='Microsoft YaHei' x='0' y='158' fontSize='15' fontWeight='bold' fill='#16232E'>一条数据处理的完整链路</text>

            <rect x='0' y='176' width='212' height='78' rx='9' fill='#EEF5FB' />
            <text fontFamily='Microsoft YaHei' x='106' y='204' fontSize='14.5' fontWeight='bold' fill='#1F5FA8' textAnchor='middle'>① 取数</text>
            <text x='106' y='228' fontSize='12.5' fill='#5A6B7A' textAnchor='middle' fontFamily='Inter'>CSV / JSON / API</text>

            <path d='M220 215 L 240 215' stroke='#1F5FA8' strokeWidth='3' fill='none' />
            <path d='M232 209 L 240 215 L 232 221' stroke='#1F5FA8' strokeWidth='3' fill='none' />

            <rect x='248' y='176' width='212' height='78' rx='9' fill='#EEF5FB' />
